Ghostwriter Dictionary Data - Licensing
========================================

This repository contains materials under two separate licenses.

1. CODE

The original source code, shell scripts, tests, and other software-specific
files in this repository are licensed under the MIT License. See
LICENSE-CODE for the complete terms.

2. DATA

Downloaded, extracted, transformed, and distributed Wiktionary/Kaikki
dictionary data, including generated wordlists and SQLite databases containing
that data, is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-SA 4.0). See LICENSE-DATA.md for the license
notice, attribution, modification statement, and canonical legal text link.

Documentation that contains or describes substantial portions of the dataset
is covered by CC BY-SA 4.0 to that extent. Original documentation and code
examples that do not contain dataset content are licensed under MIT.

No MIT license grant applies to the Wiktionary/Kaikki-derived data. No CC
BY-SA license requirement is intended to apply to independently written
software merely because it reads the separately distributed data, except to
the extent required by applicable law or the CC BY-SA 4.0 license itself.
